@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Login (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### List artists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artists

### Create artist (JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cairokee", "email": "booking@cairokee.com", "country": "Egypt" }

### List DSPs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dsps

### List tracks with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks?artistId=1&genre=pop&status=Submitted

### Track detail with DSP distribution statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/3

### Create track (JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Ya Bakht", "artistId": 1, "isrc": "EGABC1250011", "releaseDate": "2025-09-01", "genre": "Pop" }

### Distribute a track to DSPs (JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/1/distribute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dspIds": [1, 3] }

### Update track status (JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Distributed" }
